      "title": "Safety-Aware Evaluation of LLM-Generated Driver Intervention Messages through Multi-Task Risk Fusion",
      "title_zh": "基于多任务风险融合的大模型生成驾驶员干预信息安全感知评测",
      "authors": [
        "Keito Inoshita"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.22706v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.22706v1",
