      "title": "DE-NER : Zero-shot Named Entity Recognition via Dialogue Elicitation of Large Language Models",
      "title_zh": "DE-NER：基于大语言模型对话诱导的零样本命名实体识别",
      "authors": [
        "Xuankang Zhang",
        "Jiangming Liu"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.00538v1",
