      "abstract": "This survey presents agent harness engineering as an independent system layer for LLM-based agents. It proposes the ETCLOVG taxonomy covering Execution, Tooling, Context, Lifecycle, Observability, Verification, and Governance, and maps a broad corpus of open-source agent-harness projects onto this taxonomy to expose ecosystem patterns, coverage gaps, and emerging design principles. The paper argues that real-world agent reliability is shaped by the infrastructure layer around the model, including execution controls, feedback loops, governance, evaluation, and operational design.",
      "abstract_zh": "本综述将智能端子束工程定义为基于大语言模型智能体的独立系统层，提出涵盖执行、工具、上下文等七个维度的ETCLOVG分类体系，将大量开源智能端子束项目映射到该体系，揭示生态模式、覆盖缺口与新兴设计原则，提出实际场景中智能体可靠性由模型周边基础设施层决定。",
