      "title": "SkillResolve-Bench: Measuring and Resolving Same-Capability Ambiguity in Agent Skill Retrieval",
      "title_zh": "SkillResolve-Bench：测量与解决智能体技能检索中的同能力歧义",
      "authors": [
        "Jiandong Ding"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.10388v1",
