      "title": "HyperTool: Beyond Step-Wise Tool Calls for Tool-Augmented Agents",
      "title_zh": "HyperTool：面向工具增强智能体的超越逐步骤工具调用方案",
      "authors": [
        "Yaxin Du",
        "Yifan Zhou",
        "Yujie Ge",
        "Jiajun Wang",
        "Xianghe Pang",
        "Shuo Tang",
        "Tuney Zheng",
        "Bryan Dai",
        "Jian Yang",
        "Siheng Chen"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.13663v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.13663v1",
      "category": "cs.CL",
      "published": "2026-06-11 17:56:36+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-06-12",
      "abstract": "Tool-augmented LLM agents commonly rely on step-wise atomic tool calls, where each invocation, observation, and value transfer is exposed in the main reasoning trace. This creates an \\emph{execution-granularity mismatch}: locally deterministic tool workflows are unfolded into repeated model-visible decisions, consuming context and forcing the model to manage low-level dataflow in the trace. We introduce \\textbf{HyperTool}, a unified executable MCP-style tool interface that changes the model-visible unit of tool execution. A model invokes HyperTool with a code block that can call existing tools through their original schemas, manipulate returned values, and pass intermediate results locally, folding deterministic tool subroutines into a single outer call. To train models to use this interface, we synthesize HyperTool-format trajectories from cross-tool compositional tasks and verify them in real MCP environments. On MCP-Universe, HyperTool improves average accuracy from 15.69\\% to 35.29\\% on Qwen3-32B and from 9.93\\% to 33.33\\% on Qwen3-8B, and surpass GPT-OSS and Kimi-k2.5 on average accuracy, showing that our HyperTool can substantially improve multi-step tool use.",
      "abstract_zh": "现有工具增强大语言模型智能体通常依赖逐步骤原子工具调用，每次调用、观测、传值都暴露在主推理轨迹中，产生执行粒度不匹配问题：局部确定的工具工作流被展开为多个模型可见决策，消耗上下文，还迫使模型管理轨迹中的底层数据流。本文提出HyperTool，统一可执行的MCP风格工具接口，将确定性子流程折叠为单次外层调用，合成训练轨迹验证后，在MCP-Universe上Qwen3-32B平均准确率从15.69%提升到35.29%，Qwen3-8B从9.93%提升到33.33%，效果超过GPT-OSS和Kimi-k2.5。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "现有工具增强智能体逐步骤原子调用存在执行粒度不匹配，浪费上下文，迫使模型处理底层数据流。",
      "method": "提出MCP风格统一可执行工具接口HyperTool，将确定性工具子流程折叠为单次调用，合成格式轨迹训练模型。",
      "contribution": "提出HyperTool工具接口方案，大幅提升多步工具使用准确率，效果优于GPT-OSS和Kimi-k2.5等方案。",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "将确定性工具子流程折叠为单调用后，Qwen3 8B/32B在MCP-Universe准确率均提升超20个百分点，效果超过GPT-OSS和Kimi-k2.5。",
      "theme": "可执行工具接口",
      "method_family": "tool-use control",
      "agent_setting": "tool-use",
      "control_mechanism": "设计新的MCP风格可执行工具接口，将确定性工具子流程折叠为单次调用，减少模型冗余决策，优化工具调用效果。",
      "evaluation_environment": "MCP-Universe，平均准确率",
      "evaluation_signal": "在MCP-Universe基准上，Qwen3 8B和32B的平均准确率均提升超20个百分点，效果优于GPT-OSS和Kimi-k2.5。",
      "failure_mode": "执行粒度不匹配，冗余消耗上下文空间",
      "reliability_risk": "仅在MCP相关环境验证，未验证该方案在其他工具生态下的通用性与稳定性。",
      "industrial_relevance": "high",
