      "id": "2607.27703",
      "direction_id": "agent-skills-harness",
      "direction_name": "Agent Skills 与 Harness",
      "week": "2026-W31",
      "title": "SpatialCLI: Learning to Reason With Spatial Tools, Then Without Them",
      "title_zh": "SpatialCLI：先学习借助空间工具推理，再摆脱工具推理",
      "authors": [
        "Yang Zhou",
        "Zixuan Huang",
        "Sunzhu Li",
        "Zhuo Yang",
        "Chen Zhang",
        "Shunian Chen",
        "Caijun Yan",
        "Jianyao Xu",
        "Shunyu Liu",
        "Weijie Fu",
        "Peiliang Li",
        "Xiaozhi Chen",
        "Yuxiang Cai"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27703v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.27703v1",
      "category": "cs.AI",
      "published": "2026-07-30 05:39:01+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-07-31",
      "abstract": "Vision-language models (VLMs) are increasingly used in embodied agents to interpret visual inputs, reason about spatial relationships, and make task-level decisions based on that reasoning. However, a fundamental capability mismatch remains: general VLMs can reason about the overall task but often miss the visual details that determine success, while specialist vision models can capture those details but cannot translate them into task-level decisions. In this work, we propose SpatialCLI, a framework that teaches VLMs to reason with spatial tools and progressively internalize the specialist perceptual capabilities they provide. SpatialCLI proceeds in three stages: (1) Call exposes specialist vision models as spatial tools to augment the VLM's perception; (2) Learn uses Cold-Start SFT and agentic RL to improve tool use; and (3) Internalize verbalizes successful tool-use trajectories to internalize specialist perceptual capabilities. We further introduce SpatialCLI-Bench, a 516-example benchmark for compositional perception across localization, segmentation, depth, and pose. On MindCube, SpatialCLI raises Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct from 29.3% to 84.6% with tools, surpassing GPT-5.6 Sol with tools (72.1%), while retaining 73.8% without tools after internalization.",
      "abstract_zh": "视觉语言模型（VLMs）越来越多地应用于具身智能agent，用于解释视觉输入、推理空间关系并做出任务级决策，但当前存在能力错配：通用VLMs可做任务推理却常遗漏关键视觉细节，专用视觉模型可捕捉细节却无法输出任务级决策。本文提出三阶段SpatialCLI框架，让VLMs先使用空间工具再内化专用感知能力，还构建了新基准，实验验证性能提升显著。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "针对通用VLMs缺失关键视觉细节、专用视觉模型无法输出任务级决策的能力错配问题",
      "method": "提出三阶段SpatialCLI框架，将专用视觉模型作为空间工具增强VLM，训练后内化专用感知能力",
      "contribution": "提出SpatialCLI框架与SpatialCLI-Bench基准，大幅提升空间推理性能，效果优于现有基线",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "SpatialCLI将Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct的性能从29.3%提升至84.6%，超过GPT-5.6 Sol，内化后无工具仍保留73.8%性能",
      "theme": "Agent工具使用",
      "method_family": "tool-use control",
      "agent_setting": "具身空间推理 tool-use",
      "control_mechanism": "通过调用空间工具增强感知、监督微调+强化学习学习用工具、内化感知能力三阶段改进agent推理行为",
      "evaluation_environment": "SpatialCLI-Bench、MindCube，任务准确率",
      "evaluation_signal": "在MindBench上，SpatialCLI相比原Qwen模型准确率提升超55个百分点，效果优于带工具的GPT-5.6 Sol",
      "failure_mode": "空间推理中通用VLM缺关键细节、专用模型无任务决策能力的能力错配",
      "reliability_risk": "仅在516样本的小规模基准验证，泛化能力未得到充分验证，存在落地不确定性",
