      "title": "Conformal-AEDL: Uncertainty-Calibrated Neuro-Symbolic Multiagent Causal Inference for Non-Stationary Time Series",
      "title_zh": "Conformal-AEDL：面向非平稳时间序列的不确定性校准神经符号多智能体因果推断",
      "authors": [
        "Elena Rossi",
        "Lars Ø. Johansen"
      ],
      "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/f0184c33b5746e3a49c60004d258b3b4715995e5",
