      "week": "2026-W23",
      "title": "TARPO: Token-Wise Latent-Explicit Reasoning via Action-Routing Policy Optimization",
      "title_zh": "TARPO：基于动作路由策略优化的逐token隐式-显式推理",
      "authors": [
        "Liting Zhang",
        "Shiwan Zhao",
        "Xuyang Zhao",
        "Zichen Xu",
        "Jianye Wang",
        "Qicheng Li"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.05859v1",
