      "id": "2606.12634",
      "direction_id": "agent-policy-optimization",
      "direction_name": "Agent 策略优化与在线蒸馏",
      "week": "2026-W24",
      "title": "Keep Policy Gradient in Charge: Sibling-Guided Credit Distillation for Long-Horizon Tool-Use Agents",
      "title_zh": "让策略梯度主导：面向长视野工具使用Agent的兄弟引导信用蒸馏",
      "authors": [
        "Tianyu Ding",
        "Jianhong Xin",
        "Juan Pablo De la Cruz Weinstein"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.12634v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.12634v1",
      "category": "cs.LG",
      "published": "2026-06-10 19:53:20+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-06-12",
      "abstract": "Long-horizon tool-use reinforcement learning can learn from outcome verification, but its   trajectory-level advantage is broadcast across many reasoning, API, and answer tokens.   Self-distillation promises a denser signal by reusing a policy's own rollouts or a privileged   teacher. We show, however, that direct token-level self-distillation can silently destroy tool use:   it rehearses teacher behavior without knowing which actions the verifier rewards, so useful skills   and harmful shortcuts are amplified together. We introduce Sibling-Guided Credit Distillation   (SGCD), which uses distillation for credit assignment rather than as a competing actor loss.   Dynamic sampling produces mixed successful and failed sibling rollouts; an external LLM summarizes   their contrast into a training-only stepwise credit reference; dense teacher/student divergence   drives credit reassignment; and bounded detached credit weights reshape GRPO token advantages. The   deployed student sees no external LLM, sibling evidence, or oracle. Across AppWorld and   $τ^3$-airline, SGCD improves over matched GRPO comparators: AppWorld TGC $42.9 \\to 45.6$ on   test_normal and $24.7 \\to 27.0$ on test_challenge, and $τ^3$-airline pass@1 $0.583 \\to 0.602$.",
      "abstract_zh": "长视野工具使用强化学习可从结果验证学习，但轨迹级优势会分散在大量推理、API和回答token中。自蒸馏本可提供更密集信号，但直接token级自蒸馏会无差别放大有用技能和有害捷径，反而破坏工具使用能力。本文提出兄弟引导信用蒸馏SGCD，将蒸馏用于信用分配而非竞争的动作损失，部署阶段无需额外组件，在两个基准上性能优于GRPO基线。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "长视野工具使用强化学习中，直接token级自蒸馏会无差别放大有用技能与有害捷径，破坏Agent工具使用能力。",
      "method": "提出兄弟引导信用蒸馏SGCD，将蒸馏用于信用分配而非竞争动作损失，利用兄弟轨迹对比生成信用参考调整GRPO优势。",
      "contribution": "提出SGCD方法，部署无需额外组件，在两个基准上相比GRPO基线获得了稳定的性能提升。",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "直接token级自蒸馏会无差别放大好坏行为破坏工具使用，SGCD在AppWorld TGC最高提升2.7个点，τ³-airline pass@1提升0.019。",
      "theme": "工具使用策略优化",
      "method_family": "policy optimization",
      "agent_setting": "工具使用",
      "control_mechanism": "通过对比成功与失败的兄弟轨迹生成步级信用参考，将蒸馏用于信用分配，调整GRPO的token优势优化Agent策略。",
      "evaluation_environment": "AppWorld、τ³-airline，评测指标为TGC、pass@1",
      "evaluation_signal": "SGCD相比GRPO基线，在AppWorld两个测试集TGC分别提升2.7和2.3，τ³-airline pass@1提升0.019，实现了稳定性能提升。",
      "failure_mode": "直接token级自蒸馏无差别放大有用技能与有害捷径，破坏Agent工具使用能力",
      "reliability_risk": "训练阶段需要调用外部LLM生成信用参考，训练成本较高，抬高了落地应用的门槛。",
