      "evaluation_environment": "KernelBench，Fast_1阈值下的优化成功率",
      "evaluation_signal": "在KernelBench三个难度等级下，daVinci-kernel-14B分别取得37.2%、70.6%、32.2%的性能，优于基线模型",
