      "title": "KbSD: Knowledge Boundary aware Self-Distillation for Behavioral Calibration in Agentic Search",
      "title_zh": "KbSD：面向智能体搜索行为校准的知识边界感知自蒸馏",
      "authors": [
        "Tao Feng",
        "Xinke Jiang",
        "Chao Wu"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.29863v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.29863v1",
