      "week": "2026-W28",
      "title": "Do You Need a Frontier Model as a Citation Verifier? Benchmarking Rubric LLMs for Deep-Research Source Attribution",
      "title_zh": "你需要前沿模型作为引用验证器吗？深度研究来源归因的规则大语言模型基准测试",
      "authors": [
        "Ethan Leung",
        "Elias Lumer",
        "Corey Feld",
        "Austin Huber",
        "Vamse Kumar Subbiah",
        "Kevin Paul"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08700v1",
