      "week": "2026-W30",
      "title": "Why Does Feedback-Augmented Self-Distillation Fail to Improve Retrieval-Interleaved Search Agents?",
      "title_zh": "为什么反馈增强自蒸馏无法提升检索交错搜索智能体？",
      "authors": [
        "Fan Yang",
        "Rui Meng",
        "Yuxin Wen"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2607.17558v1",
